Troubleshooting Tips
Common Issues and Solutions
Satellite/Foreman connection issues:

# Check service status
systemctl status foreman
systemctl status httpd

# Restart services if needed
systemctl restart foreman
systemctl restart httpd
Permission issues with report generation:

# Ensure proper permissions
chmod +x /usr/local/bin/*.sh
chown root:root /usr/local/bin/*.sh

# Create report directories with proper permissions
mkdir -p /var/reports/{performance,patches}
chmod 755 /var/reports
Package update issues:

# Clear yum cache
yum clean all

# Update package database
yum makecache
Configuration drift false positives:

# Reset baseline after legitimate changes
rm -rf /var/lib/config-baseline/*
/usr/local/bin/config-drift-monitor.sh
